=2 Walkthrough
\**Note:** You must have completed {M:Zilart Mission 4|Zilart Mission 4|The Temple of Uggalepih}, {M:The Temple of Uggalepih|The Temple of Uggalepih|The Temple of Uggalepih} in order to receive the cutscene at the **Granite Door**.
* Head to {z:Temple of Uggalepih} in {z:Yhoator Jungle} (J-11) and enter for a cut scene.
** Quick Travel options:
*** {p:Survival Guide} works as well. Some players reported not receiving this cutscene but still was able to progress in the next step.
*** {p:Unity} Warp (122) to Yhoator Jungle will take you to **Bloodlet Spring**, just head south from there to (J-11).
*** If you do not have {p:Survival Guide}, and you grabbed {z:Den of Rancor} HP #1 while completing {M:Zilart Mission 4|Zilart Mission 4|The Temple of Uggalepih}, you can use {s:escape|Escape} to be plopped right outside the zone to {z:Temple of Uggalepih}.
* Navigate your way to the **Granite Door** on Map 3 (J-6) (Check below for how to get there) for a cutscene.

=2 Getting to (J-6)
* When you zone into {z:Temple of Uggalepih} from {z:Yhoator Jungle} (J-11), turn left after the initial stairs, then left again, and continue following the path, until you can go through the **Granite Door** at J-7. This enters a hidden section on the map.
** The {p:Voidwatch} NPC warp to the {z:Temple of Uggalepih} will put you at this entrance.
* Follow this path until you reach the top of the stairs at (J-3) (still off the visible part of the map) and zone out to {z:Yhoator Jungle} (J-9).
* Take each right (that doesn't dead-end in a tiny room), passing by the stairs leading to the ledge for an NM, and you will eventually zone back into the temple (still within {z:Yhoator Jungle} (J-9)).
** The {p:Tonberry} and {m:Bees|Bee} inside this section when you zone back in will aggro a level 99 by sight, as they are higher level than the enemies you passed to get here.
* Keep left the entire time until you reach the **Granite Door** at (J-6) in this area, then click it for the cutscene.

